OL,3,GNEWSAGravestone mystery leads to
OL,4,Aidentity of Scottish sailor lost for
OL,5,Atwo centuries
OL,6,
OL,7,FFor years, people in the tiny
OL,8,FConnecticut village of Mystic were
OL,9,Fpuzzled by a gravestone in the corner
OL,10,Fof the cemetery which read: "Unknown,
OL,11,FHMS Terror, August 13, 1814.
OL,13,FNo-one knew who was buried in the grave
OL,14,For even when the memorial stone was
OL,15,Fplaced there.
OL,17,FThe mystery drew in local historian
OL,18,FGrace Cleere, who became determined to
OL,19,Ffind out who lay in the grave and how
OL,20,Fthey ended up so far from home.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
